- HUD: Score (pop animation), Lines, Level, progress bar, piece-count stats, timer
- Overlays: Start / Pause (P) / Game Over with shake, Restart
- Mobile controls (5-way + hard/hold) + keyboard, responsive 3-column → stacked layout
- Web Audio beeps on rotate/drop, CRT scanline/grid textures, flash on level-up

